  title: Clogged esteros flood the streets
  body: Garbage that clogs esteros and drains stops rainwater from flowing away.
    The MMDA names garbage-clogged waterways as the top cause of flooding in Metro
    Manila; cleanups removed nearly 5,000 tonnes of waste from esteros in the first
    five months of 2026.
